TIES VAULT</span></div><h2 class=\"font-black text-xl sm:text-3xl font-head uppercase tracking-tight mt-1 text-darkteal\">Admin System Tools &amp; Control Panel</h2><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-darkteal mt-0.5\">Expand dropdown items below to execute database seeding, multi-node sync, CLI commands, IP inspections, and security operations.</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 bg-yellow-100 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl border-2 border-border-color font-mono text-xs shrink-0 shadow-hard-sm\"><span class=\"font-black uppercase text-black\">Status:</span><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-yellow-100 text-green-600 font-black text-xs rounded border border-border-color\">ONLINE (6 TOOLS)</span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex bg-yellow-100 items-center justify-between font-mono text-sm p-2 rounded-sm border border-border-color shadow-hard-sm\"><span class=\"font-black uppercase text-darkteal\">Tool System List (<!-- -->6<!-- --> <!-- -->items<!-- -->)</span><span class=\"font-black text-neo-pink mr-4\">2<!-- --> of <!-- -->6<!-- --> Expanded</span></div><div class=\"border border-border-color rounded-lg shadow-hard transition-all duration-200 overflow-hidden font-mono bg-soft-linen\"><div class=\"p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer select-none transition-colors hover:bg-yellow-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 flex-1 min-w-full\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-black bg-yellow-green text-darkteal border border-border-color rounded-lg shrink-0\">#<!-- -->01</span><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-lg bg-white flex items-center justify-center p-1 shrink-0\"><img src=\"/icon/button/databse.svg\" alt=\"DATABASE MANAGER\" class=\"w-6 h-6 object-contain\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"/></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-7 flex-wrap\"><h3 class=\"font-head font-bold uppercase text-base sm:text-xl text-evergreen tracking-tight truncate\">DATABASE MANAGER</h3><span class=\"text-sm font-black uppercase px-2 py-0.5 bg-green-200 text-darkteal border border-border-color rounded\">Database</span><span class=\"text-sm font-black uppercase px-2 py-0.5 border border-border-color rounded shadow-[1px_1px_0_var(--border-color)] bg-yellow-green text-black\">POSTGRESQL &amp; PRISMA</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-darkteal font-semibold mt-0.5 line-clamp-1\">Inspect PostgreSQL tables, record counts, vacuum optimization &amp; seed core catalog items.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0 self-end md:self-center\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-none border border-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-white shadow-medium hover:bg-neo-yellow transition-all duration-200 rotate-180 bg-neo-yellow\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"3\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"border-t-2 border-border-color/20 p-4 sm:p-6 bg-yellow-50 animate-fadeIn\"><div class=\"space-y-4 font-mono text-text\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border-2 text-xs font-black uppercase transition-all cursor-pointer bg-yellow-green text-black border-border-color shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--border-color)]\">TABLE STATS (<!-- -->5<!-- -->)</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border-2 text-xs font-black uppercase transition-all cursor-pointer bg-white/20 text-black border-border-color hover:bg-black/5\">DB OPERATIONS</button></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"bg-evergreen border-1 border-border-color rounded-sm overflow-hidden\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs font-mono\"><thead class=\"bg-evergreen border-b-2 border-border-color font-black text-sm text-yellow-green\"><tr><th class=\"p-3\">TABLE